cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt-exceptions in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt-exceptions: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 Exceptions & Investigations"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server that generates and validates ISO 20022
  Exceptions & Investigations messages: camt.056 FI-to-FI Payment
  Cancellation Requests and camt.029 Resolutions of Investigation. Four
  tools list the supported message types, return their required fields,
  generate XML validated against the bundled XSD and validate raw XML.
authors:
